    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>tačikinaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>тачигнах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TACIGINA-</transcript>
      <definition>[= tazigina-] onomat. v .i. To make a great noise, crash, crackle, crack, clap, peal, thunder, roar.</definition>
      <page>762</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠲᠠᠯ᠎ᠠ ᠢᠨᠢᠶᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--tal-a inijeky</transcript>
          <definition> To roar with laughter.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠵᠤ ᠳᠤᠤᠭᠠᠷᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zu duuγarxu</transcript>
          <definition> To resound, peal.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠶᠤᠩᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠳᠠᠭᠤ ᠲᠠᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>ajungγ-a jin daγu --xu</transcript>
          <definition> It is thundering.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Chinese</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠴᠢᠭᠢᠨᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
      <cyrillic>тачигнах</cyrillic>
      <definition>〔动〕①（发出破裂、爆破、断折等声响）噼里啪啦响，噼噼啪啪响，砰砰响，啪哒啪哒响；雷鸣，轰隆响；②（转）大声喧晔，大声斥责，大发雷霆，暴跳如雷.</definition>
      <page>1043</page>
